            "text": "{\"success\":true,\"result\":{\"data\":{\"title\":\"瑞安市臻格工程项目管理有限公司关于瑞安市塘下镇万景路停车场工程的公开招标公告\",\"htmlTitle\":null,\"isCustomTitle\":0,\"articleId\":\"3xOcgUAwXFvdLCeutck5Sg==\",\"siteId\":103,\"author\":\"瑞安市臻格工程项目管理有限公司\",\"projectCode\":\"RAZG2026123\",\"projectName\":\"瑞安市塘下镇万景路停车场工程\",\"publishDate\":1784900921000,\"documentNo\":null,\"redHeadFile\":null,\"rankCategoryName\":null,\"belongingName\":\"\",\"implementationDate\":null,\"announcementType\":3001,\"announcementId\":\"Q4HYwcakgNXBKDbSTd8v4ITwhJI3yMqKEmeFXDD+K4I=\",\"isGovPurchase\":false,\"districtCode\":\"900407\",\"isGovernmentPurchaseService\":null,\"categoryNames\":[\"公示公告\",\"采购公告\",\"公开招标公告\"],\"isShowAttachment\":false,\"subscriptionUrl\":null,\"supportEnglish\":null,\"englishTitle\":null,\"announcementLinkDtoList\":[{\"articleId\":\"3xOcgUAwXFvdLCeutck5Sg==\",\"type\":null,\"typeName\":\"采购公告\",\"isExist\":true,\"isCurrent\":true,\"url\":null,\"publishDate\":\"2026-07-24\",\"order\":2,\"publishDateTime\":1784900921000},{\"articleId\":null,\"type\":null,\"typeName\":\"更正公告\",\"isExist\":false,\"isCurrent\":false,\"url\":null,\"publishDate\":null,\"order\":3,\"publishDateTime\":null},{\"articleId\":null,\"type\":null,\"typeName\":\"结果公告\",\"isExist\":false,\"isCurrent\":false,\"url\":null,\"publishDate\":null,\"order\":4,\"publishDateTime\":null},{\"articleId\":null,\"type\":null,\"typeName\":\"合同公告\",\"isExist\":false,\"isCurrent\":false,\"url\":null,\"publishDate\":null,\"order\":5,\"publishDateTime\":null}],\"content\":\"<style id=\\\"fixTableStyle\\\" type=\\\"text/css\\\">th,td {border:1px solid #DDD;padding: 5px 10px;}</style><style id=\\\"template-center-style-hide-mark\\\">.template-center-hide-state{display:none !important;}</style><div><div style=\\\"border:2px solid\\\"><div style=\\\"font-family:FangSong;\\\"><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 项目概况</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; line-height:30px; \\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596015933656 code-00003 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">瑞安市塘下镇万景路停车场工程</span></span><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">招标项目的潜在投标人应在</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none;\\\"><span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1594623824358 code-23007 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">乐采云平台线上</span></span><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">获取（下载）招标文件，并于&nbsp;<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1595940588841 code-23011 addWord date-time-selection-cls\\\">2026年08月03日 09:00</span></span><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">（北京时间）前递交（上传）投标文件。</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></div></div><p style=\\\"margin: 17px 0;text-align: justify;line-height: 20px;break-after: avoid;font-size: 18px;font-family: SimHei, sans-serif;white-space: normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"><strong>一、项目基本情况</strong></span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><div style=\\\"font-family:FangSong;line-height:20px;\\\"><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 项目编号：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1595940643756 code-00004 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">RAZG2026123</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 项目名称：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596015939851 code-00003 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">瑞安市塘下镇万景路停车场工程</span></span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 预算金额（元）：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1595940673658 code-AM01400034 addWord numeric-input-box-cls readonly\\\">1027800</span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 最高限价（元）：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1589437289226 code-AM014priceCeiling addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">1027800</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 采购需求：</span></p><div><div style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: FangSong; line-height: 20px; padding: 10px; display: block; min-height: 54px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); font-weight: 400; color: black;\\\" class=\\\"template-bookmark uuid-1593419700012 code-AM014230011 text-招标项目概况 object-panel-cls\\\"><p style=\\\"line-height: 1.5em;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; display: inline-block;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1595941042480 code-AM014sectionNo editDisable \\\"></span></span><br/> &nbsp; &nbsp; 标项名称:&nbsp;<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1593432150293 code-AM014bidItemName editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">瑞安市塘下镇万景路停车场工程</span>&nbsp;<br/> &nbsp; &nbsp; 数量:&nbsp;<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1595941076685 code-AM014bidItemCount editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">1</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br/> &nbsp; &nbsp; 预算金额（元）:&nbsp;<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1593421137256 code-AM014budgetPrice editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">1027800</span>&nbsp;<br/> &nbsp; &nbsp; 简要规格描述或项目基本概况介绍、用途：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1593421202487 code-AM014briefSpecificationDesc editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">瑞安市塘下镇万景路停车场工程（具体要求详见采购文件第三章）。</span>&nbsp;<br/> &nbsp; &nbsp; 备注：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1593432166973 code-AM014remarks editDisable \\\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></div><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 合同履约期限：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1589437299696 code-AM014ContractPerformancePeriod addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">标项 1，按采购文件第三章要求。</span></span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 本项目（<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1589181188930 code-AM014cg005 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">否</span>）接受联合体投标。</span></p><p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 15px;\\\"><strong style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-family: SimHei, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\\\">二、申请人的资格要求：</strong></p></div><div style=\\\"font-family:FangSong;line-height:20px;\\\"><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 1.未被“信用中国” ( www.creditchina.gov.cn )、中国政府采购网(www.ccgp.gov.cn ] 列入失信被执行人、重大税收违法案件当事人名单、政府采购严重违法失信行为记录名单</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 2.本项目的特定资格要求：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596277470067 code-23002 editDisable multi-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\"><br/>【标项1】<br/> ①企业资质要求：市政公用工程专业三级（含）以上资质，（对应资质应在“浙江省建筑市场监管公共服务系统”上资质动态核查结果处于“合格”状态）。<br/>②具备有效的安全生产许可证；</span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><p style=\\\"margin: 17px 0;text-align: justify;line-height: 20px;break-after: avoid;font-size: 18px;font-family: SimHei, sans-serif;white-space: normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"><strong>三、获取招标文件</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><div style=\\\"font-family:FangSong;line-height:20px;\\\"><p style=\\\"line-height:20px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none;line-height:20px;\\\">时间：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1587980024345 code-23003 addWord date-selection-cls\\\">2026年07月25日</span>至<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1588129524349 code-23004 addWord date-selection-cls readonly\\\">2026年08月03日</span>&nbsp;，每天上午<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1594624027756 code-23005 addWord morning-time-section-selection-cls\\\">00:00至12:00</span>&nbsp;，下午<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1594624265677 code-23006 addWord afternoon-time-section-selection-cls\\\">12:00至23:59</span>（北京时间，线上获取法定节假日均可，线下获取文件法定节假日除外）</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 地点（网址）：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1588129635457 code-23007 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">乐采云平台线上</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 方式：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1595940713919 code-AM01400046 editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">供应商登录乐采云平台在线申请获取采购文件。</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 售价（元）：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1595940727161 code-23008 addWord numeric-input-box-cls\\\">0</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div><p style=\\\"margin: 17px 0;text-align: justify;line-height: 20px;break-after: avoid;font-size: 18px;font-family: SimHei, sans-serif;white-space: normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;line-height:20px;\\\"><strong>四、提交投标文件截止时间、开标时间和地点</strong></span></p><div style=\\\"font-family:FangSong;line-height:20px;\\\"><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none;\\\"> 提交投标文件截止时间：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1595940760210 code-23011 addWord date-time-selection-cls\\\">2026年08月03日 09:00</span>（北京时间）</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none;\\\"> 投标地点（网址）：<span style=\\\"text-decoration: none; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1594624424199 code-23012 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">通过乐采云（www.lecaiyun.com）实行在线递交。</span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 开标时间：<span style=\\\"text-decoration: none; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1594624443488 code-23013 addWord date-time-selection-cls readonly\\\">2026年08月03日 09:00</span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 开标地点（网址）：<span style=\\\"text-decoration: none; font-size: 18px;\\\"><span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1588129973591 code-23015 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">乐采云（www.lecaiyun.com）。</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></div><p style=\\\"margin: 17px 0;text-align: justify;line-height: 20px;break-after: avoid;font-size: 18px;font-family: SimHei, sans-serif;white-space: normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"><strong>五、其他补充事宜</strong></span></p><p style=\\\"line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 2em;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;font-family:FangSong;line-height:20px;\\\"><span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1589194982864 code-31006 addWord multi-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">1.本项目通过“乐采云平台（https://www.lecaiyun.com）”实行在线投标响应（电子投标），供应商通过乐采云平台下载安装“乐采云电子投标客户端”制作响应文件，同时按照本采购文件和“乐采云平台”的要求，编制并加密响应文件，供应商未按规定加密的响应文件，“乐采云平台”将予以拒收。请供应商自行前往乐采云平台下载并安装，下载网址：（https://b.zhengcaiyun.cn/luban/category?parentId=550045&amp;childrenCode=qicaiCategory17&amp;utm=luban.luban-PC-39026.959-pc-websitegroup-navBar-front.8.c8789bc0520b11efb86dbfa49a87be0d）。<br/>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2.供应商应在开标前完成CA数字证书办理。完成CA数字证书办理预计一周左右，请各供应商自行把握时间。<br/>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.供应商在使用系统进行投标的过程中遇到涉及平台使用的任何问题，可致电平台技术支持热线咨询，联系方式：95763。<br/>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4.潜在供应商应当按照规定方式获取采购文件，未按照规定方式获取采购文件的，不得对采购文件提起质疑投诉。注意：游客通道获取的采购文件仅供浏览使用，潜在供应商请通过规定方式依法获取采购文件。<br/>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5.本项目须提交投标保证金，投标保证金交纳方式及时间详见采购文件，系统显示不作参考。<br/>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6.本项目评审流程以采购文件规定为准，乐采云系统仅为辅助评标平台。</span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;font-family:FangSong;line-height:20px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\\"margin: 17px 0;text-align: justify;line-height: 32px;break-after: avoid;font-size: 21px;font-family: SimHei, sans-serif;white-space: normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\"><strong>六、对本次采购提出询问、质疑、投诉，请按以下方式联系</strong></span></p><div style=\\\"font-family:FangSong;line-height:20px;\\\"><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 1.采购人信息</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 名&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 称：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004663203 code-00014 editDisable interval-text-box-cls readonly\\\">瑞安市瑞鸿商业管理服务有限公司</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 地&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 址：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004672274 code-00018 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">瑞安市塘下镇环镇西路1001号</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 传&nbsp; &nbsp; 真：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004680354 code-00017  addWord\\\"></span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 项目联系人（询问）：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004688403 code-00015 editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">蔡先生</span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 项目联系方式（询问）：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004695990 code-00016 editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">13958855328</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 质疑联系人：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004703774 code-AM014cg001 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">/</span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 质疑联系方式：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004712085 code-AM014cg002 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">/</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <br/>&nbsp; &nbsp; 2.采购代理机构信息</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 名&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 称：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004721081 code-00009 addWord interval-text-box-cls readonly\\\">瑞安市臻格工程项目管理有限公司</span>&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 地&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 址：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004728442 code-00013 editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">瑞安市万松东路379号财税大楼7楼</span>&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 传&nbsp; &nbsp; 真：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004736097 code-00012  addWord\\\"></span>&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 项目联系人（询问）：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004745033 code-00010 editDisable single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">陈小钫</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 项目联系方式（询问）：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004753055 code-00011 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls readonly\\\">13967729387</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 质疑联系人：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004761573 code-AM014cg003 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">/</span>&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 质疑联系方式：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004769998 code-AM014cg004 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">/</span>&nbsp;　　　　　　</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <br/>&nbsp; &nbsp; 3.采购监督管理部门</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 名&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 称：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004778916 code-00019 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">瑞安市工业发展有限公司</span>&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 地&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 址：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004787211 code-00023 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">瑞安市塘下镇环镇西路1001号</span>&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 传&nbsp; &nbsp; 真：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004796586 code-00022 addWord single-line-text-input-box-cls\\\">/</span>&nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\\\"font-size: 18px;\\\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 联系人 ：<span class=\\\"bookmark-item uuid-1596004